{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","section":{"51":"The Book of Drinks"},"section_detail":{"51":{"hadithnumber_first":5540,"hadithnumber_last":5758,"arabicnumber_first":5540,"arabicnumber_last":5758,"name_native":"كتاب الأشربة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":5714,"arabicnumber":5714,"text":"اخبرنا سويد، قال انبانا عبد الله، عن هارون بن ابراهيم، عن ابن سيرين، قال بعه عصيرا ممن يتخذه طلاء ولا يتخذه خمرا","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih Isnaad Maqtu"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Isnaad Maqtu"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":51,"hadith":176}}]}